OL,3,GNEWSAWhat the Birmingham flag          
OL,4,Ainjunction means                       
OL,6,FFor months, thousands of St George's   
OL,7,Fand union jack flags have lined        
OL,8,Flamp-posts, bridges and roadsides      
OL,9,Facross parts of Birmingham, becoming   
OL,10,Fone of the city's most visible and     
OL,11,Fdebated talking points.                
OL,13,FNow Birmingham City Council has secured
OL,14,Fa High Court injunction aimed at       
OL,15,Fstopping flags being attached to street
OL,16,Ffurniture and highway infrastructure,  
OL,17,Farguing they pose a safety risk and    
OL,18,Fcontribute to tensions and disorder.   
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
