OL,3,GNEWSAWhat the Birmingham flag          
OL,4,Ainjunction means                       
OL,6,FThe ruling has prompted claims British 
OL,7,Fflags are being banned in Birmingham,  
OL,8,Fbut the judge who granted the          
OL,9,Finjunction has stressed that is not    
OL,10,Fwhat the order does.                   
OL,12,FHere is what the injunction actually   
OL,13,Fmeans for residents, businesses and    
OL,14,Fcommunity groups.                      
